{
 "cases": [
  {
   "id": "two-receipts-start-a-ledger",
   "about": "Two receipts in two currencies: a new ledger is written with a row each, the PDF is saved into receipts/ beside it and named in its row, and each currency has its own total.",
   "inputs": {
    "folder": "money"
   },
   "world": {
    "emails": [
     {
      "id": "r1",
      "from": "receipts@coffee.example",
      "subject": "Your receipt #8812",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "body": "Coffee Co receipt #8812. Total charged: £4.50"
     },
     {
      "id": "r2",
      "from": "billing@hostly.example",
      "subject": "Invoice INV-42 paid",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "body": "Hostly invoice INV-42. Total charged: $12.00. PDF attached (attachment 0).",
      "attachments": [
       {
        "filename": "invoice-42.pdf",
        "content": "Hostly invoice INV-42 — 12.00 USD — paid"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "files": {
     "money/.keep": ""
    }
   },
   "script": [
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "search_emails",
       {
        "query": "receipt",
        "max_results": 20
       }
      ],
      [
       "search_emails",
       {
        "query": "invoice",
        "max_results": 20
       }
      ],
      [
       "search_emails",
       {
        "query": "order confirmation",
        "max_results": 20
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "read_email",
       {
        "uid": "r1"
       }
      ],
      [
       "read_email",
       {
        "uid": "r2"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "download_attachment",
       {
        "uid": "r2",
        "index": 0,
        "destination": "money/receipts"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "ls",
       {
        "path": "money"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "call": [
      [
       "write_file",
       {
        "path": "money/ledger.csv",
        "content": "date,merchant,amount,currency,reference,file,uid\n2026-10-25,Coffee Co,4.50,GBP,#8812,,r1\n2026-10-26,Hostly,12.00,USD,INV-42,receipts/invoice-42.pdf,r2\n"
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": "**Filed**\n- 2026-10-25 — Coffee Co — 4.50 GBP — #8812 — no file\n- 2026-10-26 — Hostly — 12.00 USD — INV-42 — receipts/invoice-42.pdf\n\n**Not filed**\n- nothing\n\n**Totals**\n- Total this month: 4.50 GBP\n- Total this month: 12.00 USD\n\n## Report\n- filed 2 receipts in money/ledger.csv\n\n## Carry forward\n- filed: r1, r2"
    }
   ],
   "checks": [
    {
     "file": {
      "path": "money/ledger.csv",
      "contains": [
       "Coffee Co,4.50,GBP",
       "Hostly,12.00,USD",
       "date,merchant"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "file": {
      "path": "money/receipts/invoice-42.pdf",
      "contains": [
       "INV-42"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "answer_contains": [
      "4.50 GBP",
      "12.00 USD"
     ]
    },
    {
     "notebook_contains": "r2"
    }
   ]
  },
